msgid ""
"The resolver combines authored TOML with reviewed SoC/Board facts into "
"immutable typed IR and an atomic bundle. It validates modes, resources, "
"clocks, IRQs, ABI, DMA reachability and budgets. CMake owns the source "
"dependency graph; the resolver does not discover software from device names "
"or generate product workers."
msgstr ""
"解析器将人工编写的 TOML 与已审查 SoC／Board 事实组合为不可变类型化 IR 及原子生成包。它验证模式、资源、时钟、IRQ、ABI、DMA "
"可达性与预算。CMake 拥有源码依赖图；解析器不根据设备名称发现软件，也不生成产品执行任务。"

